# Fast on purpose: format and lint the staged files, then scan for secrets.
# Typecheck and tests run on push (.husky/pre-push) and in CI.
#
# --hide-all so the tasks see the staged snapshot and nothing else. The default
# hides unstaged edits to tracked files but leaves untracked ones in place, so a
# project-wide check would see files the commit does not contain.
pnpm exec lint-staged --hide-all
gitleaks git --pre-commit --redact --verbose
